  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let $z=e^{i \\theta}, \\theta \\neq \\pm n \\pi ~ n \\in I$\r\nLet $w=\\frac{e^{i \\theta}}{1-e^{i 2 \\theta}}=\\frac{1}{e^{-i \\theta}-e^{i \\theta}}=\\frac{1}{-2 \\cdot i \\sin \\theta}$\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/lmK8SwOwnDk6k0gCM8Bj7b9yXiP7dMn3TpAj0QF3e_4.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\r\n$\\therefore$ Locus is y-axis",
